<title>USA: Johnson &amp; Johnson unit acquires Nitinol.</title>
<headline>Johnson &amp; Johnson unit acquires Nitinol.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cordis Corp, a unit of Johnson &amp; Johnson,  said Moday it has acquired  Nitinol Development Corp, doing business as Nitinol Devices &amp; Components Inc, a developer of shape memory alloys.</p>
<p>With the closing of the transaction on Feb 21, NDC has become a subsidiary of Cordis and will be working closely with Cordis EndoVascular Systems Inc.  Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
